ref table fact_capacity_utilization
ref table fact_item_lifecycle
ref table fact_capacity_consumption
ref table fact_activity
ref table dim_capacity
ref table fact_refresh
ref table dim_item
ref table fact_capacity_forecast
ref table capacity_planning_summary
ref table _measure

